        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tim Armstrong, Tori Amos\n- Organizations: Rancid, Transplants, Hellcat Records\n- Products: The Stories Are True\n- Concepts: punk rock, hip hop/punk rock, mezzo-soprano, classically trained musician\n\nFacts:\n- Tori Amos was born as Myra Ellen Amos on August 22, 1963.\n- Tori Amos is an American singer-songwriter, pianist, and composer.\n- Tori Amos is a classically trained musician with a mezzo-soprano vocal range.\n- Tim Armstrong is best known as the singer and guitarist for the punk rock band Rancid and the hip hop/punk rock supergroup Transplants.\n- The Stories Are True was released on April 25, 2006, on Tim Armstrong's label Hellcat Records.",
